# Inspiring Paladin: "During your turn, this creature has first strike." Bot1's Paladin (3/3) attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's
# Memnite blocks: with first strike (CR 702.7b) the Paladin kills it before it deals damage and takes none (it would take 1
# otherwise). The keyword is there on the Paladin's controller's turn 3 and gone on Bot2's turn 2 and 4 (CR 613.1f).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Gleemox
Inspiring Paladin
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Inspiring Paladin.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Inspiring Paladin.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Inspiring Paladin.Keywords = FirstStrike
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Inspiring Paladin > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Inspiring Paladin)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Inspiring Paladin.Damage = 0
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Inspiring Paladin.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
